---

TUNER's source (upstream/tuner/tuner.s, its manifest and README) is Tim
Hastie's, from https://github.com/timhastie/octatrick-modules at tag v2.12
(commit ca13ed85547790f788ceaaada5df3cdd31508441); upstream/LICENSE is that
repository's licence file, unchanged. The Modwerk packaging in this folder
(manifest.py, octamod.module.json, README.md, TESTING.md, verify.py, evidence/,
media/ and presentation/) is by the same author under the same MIT terms.

The tuner reads the tracks' read-back arena at the layout that octabam's USB
AUDIO module documents (Sam Banks, https://github.com/sambanks/octabam). The
build system these manifests are written for is octabam, whose licence follows:

