No Elektron Music Machines firmware, extracted routine or table is included.
Every stock instruction span the module touches is named by address, length
and SHA-256 (stock_guard) and read from the user's own OS 1.40C file when the
firmware is built. Octatrack and Elektron are trademarks of Elektron Music
Machines MAV AB, used only to identify the hardware.
